00:41:22,900 --> 00:41:23,700
Inside his jacket.

1166
00:41:24,380 --> 00:41:24,740
Yeah.

1167
00:41:24,740 --> 00:41:25,620
So cute.

1168
00:41:25,700 --> 00:41:26,940
(Sweet departure, safe travels)

1169
00:41:26,940 --> 00:41:29,340
(Straightens it)

1170
00:41:42,540 --> 00:41:43,180
Xing.

1171
00:41:43,500 --> 00:41:44,180
He's come in three times

1172
00:41:44,180 --> 00:41:45,220
and said the exact same thing each time.

1173
00:41:46,660 --> 00:41:47,940
You know I'm
getting discharged today, right?

1174
00:41:48,060 --> 00:41:49,380
(Xing recovers and is discharged)
Of course I know.

1175
00:41:49,380 --> 00:41:50,260
Xing's getting discharged.

1176
00:41:50,260 --> 00:41:50,700
That's great.

1177
00:41:50,700 --> 00:41:51,700
Look at this.

1178
00:41:53,100 --> 00:41:54,780
I got you a little bouquet

1179
00:41:54,780 --> 00:41:55,900
to celebrate you getting discharged.

1180
00:41:55,900 --> 00:41:56,780
Gotta make it special.

1181
00:41:56,780 --> 00:41:57,900
I'll remember to take it.

1182
00:41:59,780 --> 00:42:00,900
Do you have a lot of stuff?

1183
00:42:00,900 --> 00:42:02,700
Looks like quite a lot.

1184
00:42:02,700 --> 00:42:03,780
Not really.

1185
00:42:03,780 --> 00:42:05,260
It's mostly just what's out here.

1186
00:42:05,700 --> 00:42:07,380
Do you need bags or anything?

1187
00:42:07,380 --> 00:42:08,300
I brought some.

1188
00:42:08,340 --> 00:42:09,780
(Prepared storage bags in advance)

1189
00:42:09,780 --> 00:42:11,140
I brought a bunch of storage bags.

1190
00:42:11,940 --> 00:42:13,100
So thoughtful.

1191
00:42:13,100 --> 00:42:14,820
So considerate.

1192
00:42:14,820 --> 00:42:16,260
Some bags are for shoes.

1193
00:42:16,260 --> 00:42:16,700
Some are

1194
00:42:16,700 --> 00:42:18,420
(Sorting her things)
for toiletries and stuff.

1195
00:42:18,420 --> 00:42:19,340
That's really thoughtful.

1196
00:42:19,780 --> 00:42:22,460
Are you in a hurry to go home?

1197
00:42:23,220 --> 00:42:24,380
You tell me.

1198
00:42:24,380 --> 00:42:26,140
My guess? No.

1199
00:42:26,380 --> 00:42:27,180
Did you guess right?

1200
00:42:27,180 --> 00:42:27,820
You did.

1201
00:42:27,820 --> 00:42:28,540
I did.

1202
00:42:29,900 --> 00:42:31,220
These two are adorable.

1203
00:42:33,100 --> 00:42:34,140
These two blankets...

1204
00:42:34,840 --> 00:42:35,480
You've used them every day.

1205
00:42:35,480 --> 00:42:37,220
You've gotten attached
to them after all these days.

1206
00:42:38,660 --> 00:42:40,260
It hurts a little, right?

1207
00:42:40,260 --> 00:42:42,020
Yeah, I still can't laugh too much.

1208
00:42:42,020 --> 00:42:44,100
I laugh really easily.

1209
00:42:45,820 --> 00:42:46,700
How was last night?

1210
00:42:46,700 --> 00:42:48,220
Did you get better rest?

1211
00:42:48,500 --> 00:42:49,300
Yeah, pretty good.

1212
00:42:51,940 --> 00:42:53,740
(Steps in to help)

1213
00:42:53,740 --> 00:42:55,500
Xing, don't move.

1214
00:42:55,500 --> 00:42:56,700
I'm worried you might...

1215
00:42:57,860 --> 00:42:58,300
Like this.

1216
00:42:58,700 --> 00:43:00,460
(Smiles)

1217
00:43:00,540 --> 00:43:01,380
What's in here?

1218
00:43:01,380 --> 00:43:03,060
There's still water.

1219
00:43:03,060 --> 00:43:04,660
Should we dump it out?

1220
00:43:04,660 --> 00:43:05,780
I'll dump it out first.

1221
00:43:06,380 --> 00:43:06,900
Okay.

1222
00:43:06,900 --> 00:43:08,180
He's so cute.

1223
00:43:08,180 --> 00:43:09,140
He loves muttering to himself.

1224
00:43:09,140 --> 00:43:10,660
Yeah, nonstop.

1225
00:43:13,380 --> 00:43:15,460
(Picks up the bag)

1226
00:43:15,500 --> 00:43:17,100
(Hurries over)
Xing, let me do it.

1227
00:43:17,100 --> 00:43:18,860
Xing, let me do it.

1228
00:43:19,060 --> 00:43:20,580
Put our letters in here.

1229
00:43:20,580 --> 00:43:21,540
(Put our letters in here)

1230
00:43:21,540 --> 00:43:22,340
Let me do it, Xing.

1231
00:43:22,340 --> 00:43:23,860
You rest. Sit for a bit.

1232
00:43:24,860 --> 00:43:26,220
He can't stop saying her name.

1233
00:43:26,220 --> 00:43:26,860
(Lets go)

1234
00:43:26,900 --> 00:43:28,420
Can the stats team

1235
00:43:28,420 --> 00:43:29,300
count how many times

1236
00:43:29,300 --> 00:43:30,740
(Counting team activated)
he's said "Xing" all season?

1237
00:43:30,740 --> 00:43:31,500
Time to count the stars.

1238
00:43:32,180 --> 00:43:33,300
However many stars are in the sky,

1239
00:43:33,300 --> 00:43:34,580
that's how many times he's said it.

1240
00:43:35,500 --> 00:43:37,340
Anything else?

1241
00:43:38,420 --> 00:43:39,380
Contact lenses.

1242
00:43:40,580 --> 00:43:42,260
I'll put these in a separate little bag.

1243
00:43:42,740 --> 00:43:43,340
Okay.

1244
00:43:43,660 --> 00:43:44,980
(Packs them separately)

1245
00:43:45,420 --> 00:43:46,700
This should work.

1246
00:43:46,700 --> 00:43:47,300
Should be fine.

1247
00:43:47,300 --> 00:43:47,940
Okay?

1248
00:43:47,940 --> 00:43:48,540
Yeah.

1249
00:43:49,260 --> 00:43:50,660
So here's what I'll do.

1250
00:43:50,660 --> 00:43:51,380
I'll head downstairs

1251
00:43:51,380 --> 00:43:53,100
and put this stuff in the car.

1252
00:43:53,660 --> 00:43:55,380
(Takes the luggage down first)
Just wait here for me.

1253
00:43:55,820 --> 00:43:56,780
(Nods)
Okay.

1254
00:43:56,780 --> 00:43:57,660
So thoughtful.

1255
00:43:57,900 --> 00:43:59,660
We should be able
to take it all in one trip, right?

1256
00:43:59,660 --> 00:44:01,340
Don't worry. We definitely can.

1257
00:44:01,340 --> 00:44:03,220
I still need to change out of this.

1258
00:44:03,220 --> 00:44:03,660
Okay.

1259
00:44:04,180 --> 00:44:04,980
That one's kinda heavy.

1260
00:44:04,980 --> 00:44:06,140
The black one.

1261
00:44:06,140 --> 00:44:06,780
This one?

1262
00:44:07,340 --> 00:44:07,780
Yeah.

1263
00:44:07,780 --> 00:44:08,900
(Loaded with luggage)

1264
00:44:09,140 --> 00:44:10,620
I'll be back in ten minutes.

1265
00:44:10,620 --> 00:44:11,420
Okay.

1266
00:44:14,100 --> 00:44:15,460
What a great guy.

1267
00:44:15,460 --> 00:44:16,100
He's working hard.

1268
00:44:16,100 --> 00:44:18,180
"I'm taking my Xing home".

1269
00:44:18,180 --> 00:44:18,900
Seriously.

1270
00:44:18,900 --> 00:44:20,220
It's like going home for the holidays.

1271
00:44:20,220 --> 00:44:20,900
Yeah.

1272
00:44:25,500 --> 00:44:27,100
He must be so happy right now.

1273
00:44:27,100 --> 00:44:28,420
The girl he likes
is out of the hospital.

1274
00:44:29,980 --> 00:44:31,300
Too far from my Xing.

1275
00:44:31,300 --> 00:44:31,900
"Too far

1276
00:44:31,900 --> 00:44:33,180
from my Xing"!

1277
00:44:33,180 --> 00:44:34,900
The car is parked far away.

1278
00:44:34,900 --> 00:44:37,260
Not you are.

1279
00:44:37,260 --> 00:44:38,620
(Parks outside the hospital)

1280
00:44:44,420 --> 00:44:45,660
All changed, Xing?

1281
00:44:48,340 --> 00:44:49,420
Then let's go.

1282
00:44:49,740 --> 00:44:50,580
Let's go.

1283
00:44:50,860 --> 00:44:52,300
You look so pretty in this dress.

1284
00:44:52,580 --> 00:44:54,300
(Smiles)

1285
00:44:55,620 --> 00:44:57,500
(Holds on tight)

1286
00:44:57,500 --> 00:44:58,900
It's right downstairs, right?

1287
00:44:58,900 --> 00:44:59,980
Yeah, right downstairs.

1288
00:45:03,660 --> 00:45:04,780
That guy's probably wondering
what's going on.

1289
00:45:05,220 --> 00:45:05,820
What?

1290
00:45:07,580 --> 00:45:08,540
So shy.

1291
00:45:13,620 --> 00:45:15,020
I'll put this in the back first.

1292
00:45:15,020 --> 00:45:16,380
Then I'll help you into the car.

1293
00:45:16,380 --> 00:45:16,980
Okay.

1294
00:45:20,260 --> 00:45:20,620
Okay.

1295
00:45:23,300 --> 00:45:24,820
(Protects her)

1296
00:45:24,820 --> 00:45:25,820
Look at that care.

1297
00:45:25,820 --> 00:45:26,660
Her knight in shining armor.

1298
00:45:28,620 --> 00:45:29,140
Okay.

1299
00:45:30,460 --> 00:45:31,380
(Adjusts the seat belt)
Put this...

1300
00:45:31,380 --> 00:45:32,820
Down here.

1301
00:45:32,820 --> 00:45:34,300
Otherwise it'll dig into you.

1302
00:45:36,660 --> 00:45:38,140
(Closes the door gently)

1303
00:45:38,180 --> 00:45:39,780
Sun Bohan's so thoughtful.

1304
00:45:45,900 --> 00:45:46,940
I'm fine like this.

1305
00:45:46,940 --> 00:45:47,820
Yeah, that's fine.

1306
00:45:47,820 --> 00:45:49,900
Just in case your stomach gets cold.

1307
00:45:51,380 --> 00:45:52,260
(Takes out a cushion)

1308
00:45:52,380 --> 00:45:53,940
Okay, I'll just put it here.

1309
00:45:53,940 --> 00:45:55,020
Okay, cover up a little.

1310
00:45:56,020 --> 00:45:57,260
(Smiles)

1311
00:45:57,260 --> 00:45:57,940
Happy?

1312
00:46:00,500 --> 00:46:01,860
I'm really happy too.

1313
00:46:03,900 --> 00:46:04,620
We can tell.

1314
00:46:04,980 --> 00:46:05,730
Oh my gosh.

1315
00:46:07,780 --> 00:46:09,220
Do you get carsick, Xing?

1316
00:46:09,220 --> 00:46:09,820
No.

1317
00:46:09,820 --> 00:46:10,980
You don't? Good.

1318
00:46:10,980 --> 00:46:11,580
I'll drive slower.

1319
00:46:11,580 --> 00:46:12,540
I'll keep it smooth.

1320
00:46:14,340 --> 00:46:17,020
A few days ago, when you weren't there,

1321
00:46:17,740 --> 00:46:18,780
especially at first,

1322
00:46:18,780 --> 00:46:20,500
during your first couple days
in the hospital,

1323
00:46:20,940 --> 00:46:22,660
whenever Si came back,

1324
00:46:22,660 --> 00:46:24,780
I'd get confused for a second, you know?

1325
00:46:26,660 --> 00:46:28,380
I kept feeling like...

1326
00:46:29,380 --> 00:46:31,100
you'd suddenly come back.

1327
00:46:31,100 --> 00:46:32,580
Even though I knew it wasn't you.

1328
00:46:34,380 --> 00:46:35,060
(Glances)
But it's okay now.

1329
00:46:35,060 --> 00:46:36,380
You're finally out.

1330
00:46:36,420 --> 00:46:37,260
(Glances again)

1331
00:46:40,260 --> 00:46:41,500
Maybe everyone else

1332
00:46:41,500 --> 00:46:43,460
still thinks you and Si look alike.

1333
00:46:43,780 --> 00:46:46,020
But I think Cui Yihang and I

1334
00:46:46,020 --> 00:46:47,820
can tell you two apart instantly.

1335
00:46:47,860 --> 00:46:49,140
(I can always recognize you)

1336
00:46:49,140 --> 00:46:49,620
Yeah.

1337
00:46:50,060 --> 00:46:51,500
I wonder how they're doing.

1338
00:46:52,100 --> 00:46:53,700
They're definitely having a blast.

1339
00:46:54,340 --> 00:46:55,980
No doubt about it.

1340
00:46:56,460 --> 00:46:57,700
We'll ask them when they're back.

1341
00:46:59,620 --> 00:47:00,980
I'm pretty happy right now too.

1342
00:47:03,380 --> 00:47:04,780
Honestly, anywhere's fine.

1343
00:47:10,980 --> 00:47:12,140
Even the heavens are moved.

1344
00:47:14,900 --> 00:47:16,300
Seeing this heavy rain again

1345
00:47:16,300 --> 00:47:17,940
gives me a bad feeling.

1346
00:47:18,940 --> 00:47:20,220
Whenever I see rain this heavy now,

1347
00:47:20,220 --> 00:47:21,260
I always

1348
00:47:21,820 --> 00:47:25,300
start feeling a little...

1349
00:47:25,820 --> 00:47:26,660
Traumatized?

1350
00:47:26,660 --> 00:47:28,340
Yeah, I'm seriously traumatized now.

1351
00:47:28,340 --> 00:47:29,860
I'm scared it'll keep getting heavier.

1352
00:47:31,260 --> 00:47:32,060
But it's okay.

1353
00:47:32,060 --> 00:47:32,820
You weren't there that day.

1354
00:47:32,820 --> 00:47:34,380
You're here today, so I don't care.

1355
00:47:34,380 --> 00:47:35,820
(You're here today, so I don't care)

1356
00:47:35,820 --> 00:47:36,330
Oh my gosh.

1357
00:47:37,340 --> 00:47:39,540
He says what's in his heart so casually.

1358
00:47:40,020 --> 00:47:41,260
He's so smooth.

1359
00:47:41,900 --> 00:47:43,420
His mouth finally
keeps up with his brain.

1360
00:47:43,420 --> 00:47:44,300
It finally does.

1361
00:47:47,860 --> 00:47:48,420
When you were little,

1362
00:47:48,420 --> 00:47:49,820
would you cry if people criticized you?

1363
00:47:49,820 --> 00:47:50,780
No.

1364
00:47:52,300 --> 00:47:54,380
Feels like all the tears

1365
00:47:54,540 --> 00:47:56,500
from the past few years
came out these last few days.

1366
00:47:57,660 --> 00:47:58,860
I hope from now on,

1367
00:47:58,860 --> 00:48:00,140
we stay out of hospitals.

1368
00:48:06,620 --> 00:48:07,780
Congrats, Xing.

1369
00:48:08,540 --> 00:48:09,980
Let's congratulate Xing

1370
00:48:09,980 --> 00:48:11,300
on getting discharged!

1371
00:48:11,300 --> 00:48:12,980
That last line was so touching.

1372
00:48:12,980 --> 00:48:13,700
She's out of the hospital.

1373
00:48:13,700 --> 00:48:14,380
Stay healthy.

1374
00:48:14,740 --> 00:48:15,620
And I hope Sun Bohan

1375
00:48:15,620 --> 00:48:16,220
keeps taking

1376
00:48:16,220 --> 00:48:16,780
good care of her.

1377
00:48:18,020 --> 00:48:19,540
I realized he genuinely

1378
00:48:19,540 --> 00:48:21,300
enjoys taking care of people.

1379
00:48:21,300 --> 00:48:22,220
At this point,

1380
00:48:22,220 --> 00:48:23,580
he's not doing it for show.

1381
00:48:23,580 --> 00:48:24,620
He really enjoys it.

1382
00:48:24,620 --> 00:48:25,540
(Agrees)

1383
00:48:25,540 --> 00:48:26,620
He notices everything.

1384
00:48:26,620 --> 00:48:28,260
Every little thing is handled

1385
00:48:28,260 --> 00:48:28,860
so carefully.

1386
00:48:28,860 --> 00:48:30,540
This side of him is really cute too.

1387
00:48:30,540 --> 00:48:30,940
I think

1388
00:48:30,940 --> 00:48:32,060
not every guy

1389
00:48:32,060 --> 00:48:33,380
is like that, right?

1390
00:48:33,620 --> 00:48:34,060
First of all,

1391
00:48:34,060 --> 00:48:34,620
some people

1392
00:48:34,620 --> 00:48:35,860
don't even notice what needs doing.

1393
00:48:36,460 --> 00:48:36,820
Yeah.

1394
00:48:36,820 --> 00:48:37,700
Like those bags.

1395
00:48:37,700 --> 00:48:38,980
He knew how to separate everything.

1396
00:48:38,980 --> 00:48:39,340
How...

1397
00:48:39,660 --> 00:48:40,260
If...

1398
00:48:40,260 --> 00:48:41,380
If you're not attentive,

1399
00:48:41,380 --> 00:48:41,940
you won't notice it.

1400
00:48:41,940 --> 00:48:43,260
You wouldn't even think to do that.

1401
00:48:43,780 --> 00:48:45,500
Yeah, but what's rare about him

1402
00:48:45,500 --> 00:48:46,820
is he notices things,

1403
00:48:46,820 --> 00:48:47,500
he acts on them,

1404
00:48:47,500 --> 00:48:48,700
and he communicates too.

1405
00:48:48,700 --> 00:48:49,540
(Sun Bohan always keeps her updated)

1406
00:48:49,540 --> 00:48:50,260
That's...

1407
00:48:52,220 --> 00:48:54,180
(Easy communication)
He says it and does it.

1408
00:48:54,540 --> 00:48:55,540
I've never seen anything like it.

1409
00:48:55,540 --> 00:48:56,980
Seriously, he's so good.

1410
00:48:57,340 --> 00:48:57,980
Yeah.

1411
00:48:57,980 --> 00:48:58,500
It's really nice.

1412
00:48:58,500 --> 00:48:59,660
Let's wish them well.

1413
00:48:59,660 --> 00:49:00,900
Hope everything goes smoothly from here.

1414
00:49:00,900 --> 00:49:02,860
And stay healthy.

1415
00:49:02,860 --> 00:49:03,580
Okay.

1416
00:49:03,580 --> 00:49:04,740
Let's keep watching.

1417
00:49:07,100 --> 00:49:09,820
(Couples House)

1418
00:49:12,740 --> 00:49:13,740
We're here.

1419
00:49:13,740 --> 00:49:14,860
We're here. Let's go.

1420
00:49:15,140 --> 00:49:15,620
Let's go.

1421
00:49:15,620 --> 00:49:16,380
Come on.

1422
00:49:16,820 --> 00:49:18,220
Everyone's back.

1423
00:49:18,220 --> 00:49:18,980
All together again.

1424
00:49:18,980 --> 00:49:19,900
Your water bottle.

1425
00:49:20,180 --> 00:49:21,300
Thank you.

1426
00:49:23,660 --> 00:49:24,540
Hello.

1427
00:49:24,700 --> 00:49:25,700
Hi.

1428
00:49:26,740 --> 00:49:27,740
Hello.

1429
00:49:28,780 --> 00:49:31,260
Hello.

1430
00:49:32,100 --> 00:49:32,740
Careful.

1431
00:49:33,940 --> 00:49:35,300
Hey.

1432
00:49:35,620 --> 00:49:37,140
The four of them went out together?

1433
00:49:37,740 --> 00:49:39,580
They probably went to pick them up.

1434
00:49:41,540 --> 00:49:42,780
Did you guys go out this afternoon?

1435
00:49:43,060 --> 00:49:43,780
Yeah.

1436
00:49:43,780 --> 00:49:44,780
Where'd you go?

1437
00:49:44,780 --> 00:49:45,860
We went to the mall.

1438
00:49:45,860 --> 00:49:46,700
Wow.

1439
00:49:46,700 --> 00:49:47,020
Here.

1440
00:49:47,020 --> 00:49:47,700
That's so nice.

1441
00:49:49,580 --> 00:49:50,180
Medicine.

1442
00:49:50,340 --> 00:49:51,660
What medicine?

1443
00:49:51,660 --> 00:49:52,660
You said you had a canker sore.

1444
00:49:54,780 --> 00:49:56,900
(The night before)
It hurts. It hurts whenever I smile.

1445
00:49:57,300 --> 00:49:59,820
(Noticed)

1446
00:50:00,060 --> 00:50:00,940
